Revision history for Net-OpenSSH-More

1.04 2026-09-18 TEODESIAN
    - Fix test failure due to inability to open a port

1.03 2026-09-17 TEODESIAN
    - Honour retry_interval between connection attempts
    - Stop retrying a credential the far end refused, unless retry_on_auth_failure asks
    - Forward the master's stderr handle rather than a misspelling of it
    - Check a cached or adopted connection still reaches its far end before reusing it
    - Publish the master's control socket for reuse, which the old condition never allowed
    - Stop the retry diagnostics printing an empty host and warning twice about it

1.02 2026-09-03 TEODESIAN
    - Fix bused DNS resolution logic

1.01 2026-05-19 TEODESIAN
    - Fixes to documentation formatting
    - Address some install test issues

1.00 2024-08-08 TEODESIAN
    - Initial release
